      "en": "Hear the LORD’s word, O house of Jacob, and all the families of the house of Israel!",
      "ko": "야곱 집과 이스라엘 집 모든 가족아 나 여호와의 말을 들으라",
      "source_text_hash": "0e517d9c7455f989096c968952410ff568bfe8c89dec9007374411ee79195e2c",
      "translation_text_hash": "100db088eeceeb50860fa0143636d90e22a964f9ff8f009b94537cb6d37c3cd7",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
