      "en": "“Therefore I will yet contend with you,” says the LORD, “and I will contend with your children’s children.",
      "ko": "그러므로 내가 여전히 너희와 다투고 너희 후손과도 다투리라 여호와의 말이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "6b6329114aa8342dec7e2b659e139d9840cfb63da02debd2f637bc9c7eb063a7",
      "translation_text_hash": "f514047de437323caaa0e5a743a394b2f0166eaa7e72a14099ea0f2e8c2f11a6",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그러므로 내가 여전히 너희와 다투고 너희 후손과도 다투리라 여호와의 말이니라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "f514047de437323caaa0e5a743a394b2f0166eaa7e72a14099ea0f2e8c2f11a6"
