      "en": "The young lions have roared at him and raised their voices. They have made his land waste. His cities are burned up, without inhabitant.",
      "ko": "어린 사자들이 너를 향하여 부르짖으며 소리를 날려 네 땅을 황무케 하였으며 네 성읍들은 불타서 거민이 없게 되었으며",
      "source_text_hash": "011823a9c219a4fe2593133a321aff61bab08f64dd38a5dad39750bf39db0b1b",
      "translation_text_hash": "0b8a1f45fdeeb6b3a412f686d29ee5e5f3cc2c7697b9def60d820338ebb72044",
