      "en": "“Haven’t you brought this on yourself, in that you have forsaken the LORD your God, when he led you by the way?",
      "ko": "네 하나님 여호와가 너를 길로 인도할 때에 네가 나를 떠남으로 이를 자취함이 아니냐",
      "source_text_hash": "19f4a1adfe616378f7bba5984829ffa1599092321fd7de7b38e6af40f5e6d451",
      "translation_text_hash": "134d23f1df9558f2e101a9e1bf3ef09059f8149a05c3ef05dd96a2fa8aa3904b",
