      ],
      "en": "Yet I had planted you a noble vine, a pure and faithful seed. How then have you turned into the degenerate branches of a foreign vine to me?",
      "ko": "내가 너를 순전한 참 종자 곧 귀한 포도나무로 심었거늘 내게 대하여 이방 포도나무의 악한 가지가 됨은 어찜이뇨",
      "source_text_hash": "09a87f1b691b3b43882c63a9475dad276ef07908b51b6360b944fe6229a09158",
      "translation_text_hash": "49a011593f321f2886bb2f493607a66b6d73344c0e676d64894893f60e0707f0",
