      "en": "“Why will you contend with me? You all have transgressed against me,” says the LORD.",
      "ko": "나 여호와가 말하노라 너희가 나와 다툼은 어찜이뇨 너희가 다 내게 범과하였느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "0c4bbc50f3b24a09be1ae628b8f1c904913c5df9699b26377a11b58855247e3b",
      "translation_text_hash": "87fb3dbd75cd294a7a4388415f89a0aaca8a252042ee82120df872ba03e8ecb5",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
