      "en": "“I have struck your children in vain. They received no correction. Your own sword has devoured your prophets, like a destroying lion.",
      "ko": "내가 너희 자녀를 때림도 무익함은 그들도 징책을 받지 아니함이라 너희 칼이 사나운 사자 같이 너희 선지자들을 삼켰느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "a46a03a3b06e5bf8a0779b91b5497e82629522cd6e45b7eec5aff3da3854ff7e",
      "translation_text_hash": "6db603d8c2367c7668d432326866b29628443bde662dd022e0d24e1790c2dfa8",
